{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10259","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得适字 · 刘舟","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得适字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大名掩诸古，独断无不适。\n德遂天下宗，官爲幕中客。\n骊山浮云散，灞岸零雨夕。\n请业非远期，圆光再生魄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘舟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}